---
layout: base.njk
title: CRO Insights & Blog — Jordan Shapiro | Conversion Rate Optimization
description: Practical CRO insights from Jordan Shapiro — covering ROI measurement, A/B testing strategy, personalization, and conversion optimization.
permalink: /blog/index.html
---

<nav class="breadcrumb-nav" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
  <ol class="breadcrumb-list">
    <li><a href="/CRO-Consulting/">Home</a></li>
    <li aria-current="page">Blog</li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<main>
  <section class="blog-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>CRO Insights</h1>
      <p>Practical thinking on experimentation, measurement, and conversion strategy &mdash; from 250+ tests in the field.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blog-index-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="blog-grid">
        {% for post in blogPosts %}
          <a class="blog-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
            {% if post.imageUrl %}
              <img class="blog-card-img" src="{{ post.imageUrl }}" alt="{{ post.imageAlt or post.title }}" loading="lazy">
            {% endif %}
            <div class="blog-card-body">
              <div class="blog-meta">
                {% if post.readTime %}<span>{{ post.readTime }}</span>{% endif %}
                {% if post.readTime and post.publishDate %}<span class="blog-meta-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% endif %}
                {% if post.publishDate %}<span>{{ post.publishDate | readableDate }}</span>{% endif %}
              </div>
              <h2>{{ post.title }}</h2>
              {% if post.summary %}<p class="blog-card-excerpt">{{ post.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
              <span class="blog-card-link">Read post <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
            </div>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
